      "text": "Recordings json breakdown into spark schema \n\nRoot Object\n│\n├── id\n│\n└── media\n      │\n      ▼\n     Array\n      │\n      ▼\n   Object\n      │\n      └── tracks\n             │\n             ▼\n           Array\n             │\n             ▼\n          Object\n          │\n          ├── id\n          ├── title\n          └── recording\n                  │\n                  ▼\n                Object\n                │\n                ├── id\n                ├── title\n                └── length",
